# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Deliberately NOT excepted: the npm dependencies (brace-expansion, undici) found in the same
# scan. They ship inside npm's own node_modules, so a Node bump is the fix, and this change
# carries one (24.22.1 to 24.22.2). If the first CI run still reports them, the answer is an npm
# bump or an upstream Node release, not a line here.
